WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.969
-It's almost summer,
and everyone is excited

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:05.105
to finally go on vacation again.
-I already booked my trip.

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.672
-Oh, hey, Ally.
And a Heineken, huh?

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.274
Looks like you're
on vacation already.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.376
-You know it, but since
you're still on the clock,

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.145
I got you a can
of Heineken 0.0.

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:15.281
Zero alcohol.
-Oh! Well, thank you.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:17.149
Mmm. I didn't realize
it came in cans.

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:19.652
-Well, I'm glad it does,
'cause my friends and I rented

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.754
a pontoon boat for our vacation
to the lake,

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:23.856
and you can't bring
glass bottles on the boat.

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:25.558
-A pontoon boat?
That sounds fun.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:28.528
-Yeah, except
we booked it for 9:00.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:29.996
-A.M.?
-I know, right?

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:31.264
Sounds like a tee time.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:32.498
-Well, better than 9:00 P.M.

00:00:32.498 --> 00:00:34.100
-Actually, that's when
we booked our tee time.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.035
-How? Are you playing mini golf?
-Oh!

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:37.503
[ Fingers snap ]
Speaking of mini, we booked

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:39.105
a one-room cabin
for the eight of us.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.372
-Wow. So it sounds like you guys

00:00:40.372 --> 00:00:42.175
are a little rusty
at planning vacations.

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.110
Did you at least get
trip insurance?

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.578
-There's trip insurance?

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.847
-Have you ever been
on vacation before, Ally?

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.182
-I-I went on a cruise once.

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:50.549
-That's not where
I was going with that.

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:52.051
-Ugh. This is gonna
be a disaster, isn't it?

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:53.686
-You know what? Just have
a cooler of these handy,

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.154
and you'll have a good time
no matter what.

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:58.057
-You're right.
Lake Chernobyl, here we come!

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:00.426
-Yeah, how do you feel about
maybe a staycation?

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:02.328
Open your camera now
and scan the code

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:05.965
to find a can of Heineken
or Heineken 0.0 near you

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.435
to enjoy the same
light, refreshing taste

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:11.237
no matter what
your summer plans are.

